"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"28"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is an extremely mild-mannered, and a somewhat natural-feeling wife. Her husband (50 years old) is a section chief at a trading company and is moderately wealthy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has only one man in her life, as they had an arranged marriage immediately after graduating from an all-girls' junior high, high school, and university."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her husband, who is much older than her, sees her as his “daughter,” and she has had almost no sexual intercourse with him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is extremely frustrated, but is unaware of it. A minor incident leads her to recognize Kouhei as a “man,” and she is unable to stop her physical desires."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c70753"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"商社に勤める夫（50歳）を持つ奥さん。28歳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"極めて温厚で優しく、やや天然の入った女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫は課長で、家庭はそこそこ裕福。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"中高大一貫の女子校を卒業後直ぐに見合いで今の夫と結婚。それまで男性との交際経験はなく、性交渉も夫が初めて。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"歳の離れた夫から「娘」感覚で見られ、夫婦の営みは新婚のときの少しだけで、現在は皆無に近い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"欲求不満状態だが、彼女自身は自覚しておらず、主人公と接するようになって、その肉体の性的欲求に気付く。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15316","sourceWorkId":"12423","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"極めて温厚でやや天然っぽい柔和な奥さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫(50)は商社に勤める課長でそこそこ裕福。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"中高大一貫の女子校を卒業後直ぐに見合い結婚をしたため、男性経験は夫１人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"歳の離れた夫からは「娘」感覚で見られ、性行為はほぼ皆無。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"非常に欲求不満状態だが自覚していない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"些細なきっかけから公平を「男」と認識することになり、肉体的な欲望に歯止めが利かなくなってしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"198940"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"28 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15316","sourceWorkId":"12423","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f8/f8d0bb9448bdf481656df7ba1cfe467f5281089d6afb1963c433d13853151a45.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/ffac21b1bd523a2f611833d918e6f472334c1f3f006cd9544dfffe0a3eb7859c.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山口瑞樹","creatorId":"vndb:s338","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s338","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s338","name":"山口 瑞樹","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:81254:198940:16462:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c70754","characterName":"秋田 沙織","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"198941","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"81254"}],"egsCharacterIds":["15317"],"vndbCharacterId":"c70754"},"originalCharacterName":"秋田 沙織","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"30"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has experience as a race queen when she was in junior college and is confident in her good looks. Her husband of nine years (34 years old) is the president of a small business, but the business is not doing well."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is an arrogant and vain person, and wears luxury brand goods, At home, however, she wears a casual outfit of a jersey and T-shirt. She never shows such an appearance to those around her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is lonely and mentally fragile and breaks down easily. Her pride and haughtiness are nothing more than glass armor to hide her weakness. In reality, she is a very devoted and good-looking woman."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c70754"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"中小企業を経営する社長を夫（34歳）に持つ奥さん。30歳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、夫の会社はあまりうまくいっておらず、先行きが不安。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高飛車で見栄っ張り、高級ブランド品を身に付けて街を歩くことがステイタスのような女性だが、自宅ではジャージ姿にTシャツといったラフな格好を好み、オンとオフがはっきりしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美貌には絶対の自信を持ち、短大時代はレースクィーンの経験もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな彼女は精神的には脆く崩れやすく、常日頃の高慢な態度はそうした自分の弱さをカモフラージュしたい気持ちの表われ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本当は惚れた相手にはとことん尽くす可愛い女。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15317","sourceWorkId":"12423","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"短大時代にはレースクイーンの経験があり、美貌には自信を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結婚9年目の夫(34)は中小企業の社長だが、経営がうまくいっていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高飛車で見栄っ張りな性格なため高級ブランド品を身に付けているが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自宅ではジャージにＴシャツといったラフな格好をしており、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そういう姿は周りには一切見せない。寂しがり屋で精神的にも脆く崩れやすく、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"プライドの高さや高慢さは、弱い自分を隠す為のガラスの鎧でしかない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実際にはかなり尽くすタイプのイイ女。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"198941"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"30 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15317","sourceWorkId":"12423","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/68/6832c8a9a66e9202ef67d7e6aa76a3efea884c241255e0cc4afbc341442f7776.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/19/1970bfdba8fc6790d3f9fb71910c77693aa1c2058b1087433fe70221d835383d.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"川瀬ゆう子","creatorId":"vndb:s647","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s647","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s647","name":"川瀬 ゆう子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:81254:198941:16174:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c70755","characterName":"四谷 公平","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c70755"},"originalCharacterName":"